  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to Colombia&#xB4;s Largest Wind Farm (800MW)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia&#xB4;s largest wind park with an installed capacity of 800MW is operational and contributes to avoid the emission of 267,330 ton of CO2/year in alignment with Colombia&#xB4;s NDC targets and post-COVID Economic Recovery Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GGGI and Jemeiwaa propose a collaboration aimed at ensuring that the wind parks and the corresponding rural electrification projects are delivered with the highest technical, environmental and social standards and to ensure the wind parks can initiate their operations without delays.</narrative>
  </description>
